  "content": "\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5868 size-full\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_bg_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2764\" height=\"1019\" />\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ngNQjT5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/96753964485181440/widget.png?style=banner2\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/kreezxil\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/joj33k55.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MinecraftModdedForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/efhmdjhg.png\" /></a></p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<a href=\"https://kreezcraft.com/bedwars-item-generator\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5869\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_bg_promocard-300x51.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"51\" /></a>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">如果您想毫不費力地使用「床戰物品生成器」架設伺服器，請前往<a href=\"https://kreezcraft.com/bedwars-item-generator\">BisectHosting 購買伺服器</a>，並使用優惠碼 kreezxil 為新用戶享受首月 25% 折扣。</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5870 size-full\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_bg_description.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2764\" height=\"270\" />\n<h2>描述</h2>\n特殊的方塊會將與其類型相符的物品生成到世界中。不過黑曜石除外，它會隨機生成金錠、鐵錠或鑽石。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n將該方塊放入合成欄位即可切換成下一種類型。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n您也可以使用鐵方塊、下界之星與床來製作鐵生成器。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n輸入紅石訊號即可關閉它。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5871 size-full\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_bg_recipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2764\" height=\"270\" /> </span>\n<h2>合成配方</h2>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5872\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/fiRrmks.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"286\" />\n鐵生成器\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5873\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/zrTdRWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"128\" />\n\n金生成器\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5874\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/JS45C7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"129\" />\n\n鑽石生成器\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5875\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IdLLbbV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"128\" />\n\n黑曜石生成器\n\n&nbsp;\n<h2>整合包</h2>\n無需詢問，直接加入即可。若能附上本站連結會很好，但並非強制要求。\n\n&nbsp;\n<h2>直播主與影片創作者</h2>\n非常歡迎！請在下方留言區分享您的直播與影片連結，我會將其添加到總覽中。這等於為您帶來免費宣傳！\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5876 size-large\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_bg_config-1024x100.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"100\" />\n<h2>如何進行設定</h2>\n<p><a href/embed/QqHvKVcgWdI?wmode=transparent\">影片示範</a></p>\n\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>本專案自豪地採用 FORGE 驅動</strong>，沒有它將無法實現。支持 FORGE 移除 Adfocus 廣告，請至 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LexManos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.patreon.com/LexManos</a>。\n\n&nbsp;",
